<h1 class="page-title">API Reference</h1>
<p class="page-lead">Complete reference for <code>RetryManager</code> and its public methods.</p>

<h2>Factory functions</h2>

<h3><code>createRetryer(options?)</code></h3>
<p>Creates and returns a <code>RetryManager</code> instance. Equivalent to <code>new RetryManager(options)</code>.</p>
<CodeBlock code={_shikiCode0} lang="typescript" />

<h3><code>createRetryStrategy(config)</code></h3>
<p>Creates a custom <code>IRetryStrategy</code> from a plain config object.</p>
<CodeBlock code={_shikiCode1} lang="typescript" />

